  "title": "EVS: Fix TCX/HQ-MDCT core values",
  "description": "TBH, I am not sure whether this PR is correct since I can't find which spec defines the TCX/HQ-MDCT core values. I just \"refer\" https://www.3gpp.org/ftp/tsg_sa/WG4_CODEC/EVS_Testing/CR26442-0010-ANSI-C_source_code/c-code/lib_com/bitstream_fx.c:\n\n```\nvoid decision_matrix_core_dec(\n    Decoder_State_fx *st                 /* i/o: decoder state structure                   */\n)\n{\n    ......\n    IF ( sub(st->core_fx, HQ_CORE) == 0 )\n    {\n        /* read the HQ/TCX core switching flag */\n        if ( get_next_indice_fx( st, 1 ) != 0 )\n        {\n            st->core_fx = TCX_20_CORE;\n            move16();\n        }\n        ......\n    }\n    ......\n}\n```\n\nSo I think TCX \"should be\" 1. Anyway, if my understanding is wrong, please reject this PR, thanks very much for your time first!",
